---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How CALTEC Instrument Services handles information shared through this website.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy policy" lede="Plain-language information about what this website collects and how we use it." />
  <section class="pb-28">
    <div class="wrap max-w-3xl">
      <div class="prose-caltec">
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>This website is operated by {site.name}, {site.address.lines.join(', ')}. Our website address is {site.url}.</p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>This site does not use accounts or store form submissions on our servers. When you send an enquiry, the details you enter are placed into an email or WhatsApp message on your own device, and are only shared with us when you choose to send it.</p>
        <p>Like most websites, our hosting provider may keep standard technical logs (such as IP address, browser type and pages requested) for security and performance purposes.</p>

        <h2>How we use your information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to enquiries and prepare quotations.</li>
          <li>To deliver and document calibration, inspection and validation services.</li>
          <li>To meet legal, accounting and quality-system record-keeping obligations.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

        <h2>Embedded content</h2>
        <p>Pages may include embedded content, such as maps, from other websites. Embedded content behaves as if you visited that website directly, and it may collect data under its own privacy policy.</p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>You can ask us what personal information we hold about you, and request that we correct or delete it, subject to any records we must keep by law.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about privacy can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${site.emails.info}`}>{site.emails.info}</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
